{"4465410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MMA Career Simulator", "steam_appid": 4465410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5164040], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.poster.avif?t=1787851795\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.webm?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.mp4?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your MMA fighter, develop their skills, build winning game plans, and promote yourself to a global MMA superstar. Every fight is simulated based on your preparation and in-fight decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through multiple leagues, earn promotions, unlock powerful perks, and chase championship belts across different weight classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.poster.avif?t=1787851795\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.webm?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.mp4?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character builder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training camps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gameplan system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple fight leagues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Promotion system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple weight classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomized events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Career Mode playthrough offers a fresh experience, with newly unlocked backgrounds, unique perks, randomized events, and a new lineup of opponents. Will you rise to the top and claim the title of world champion, or will you fall short, ending up a broke journeyman used as a stepping stone for the next generation of rising stars?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.poster.avif?t=1787851795\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.webm?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/e9648f0dd77c56bd4fa7a85db04b1e58.mp4?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your MMA fighter, develop their skills, build winning game plans, and promote yourself to a global MMA superstar. Every fight is simulated based on your preparation and in-fight decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through multiple leagues, earn promotions, unlock powerful perks, and chase championship belts across different weight classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.poster.avif?t=1787851795\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.webm?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/extras/ff96aa6454c3e68d776f3f435c1316c4.mp4?t=1787851795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character builder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training camps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gameplan system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple fight leagues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Promotion system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple weight classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomized events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Career Mode playthrough offers a fresh experience, with newly unlocked backgrounds, unique perks, randomized events, and a new lineup of opponents. Will you rise to the top and claim the title of world champion, or will you fall short, ending up a broke journeyman used as a stepping stone for the next generation of rising stars?</p>", "short_description": "Create your MMA fighter, develop their skills, build winning game plans, and promote yourself to a global MMA superstar. Every fight is simulated based on your preparation and in-fight decisions, where smart choices can mean the difference between victory and defeat.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/b901bbed2e07d502e86c5286700525a35582005d/header.jpg?t=1787851795", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4465410/b3400349f6183ce01faf7d4c4ff219920264bc75/capsul